 "about": "Fixed evaluation split. MCPTox is split by server and the npm benign descriptions by package, so no server or package appears on both sides. npm_nonen splits the non-English npm descriptions by package within each language; external splits the independent sets (MCP-SafetyBench, MSB, mcp-tool-poisoning) by server or tool into dev, for choosing between training runs, and test. Rules and fine-tuning may only look at mcptox.dev, npm.train, npm.calib, npm_nonen.train and npm_nonen.calib; results are reported on the test parts. Made with a seeded shuffle (seed 0) that fills each split to its share of rows.",
